  "bodyHash": "FzsqciLrvRE=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎來到 Soartex 的粉絲延續版本，這是由 Soar49 所創始的流暢 64x 紋理包！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這裡是找到 Soartex Fanver 通用包的地方。通用包同時包含原版與模組的紋理。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.16</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:68722\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.15</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:628\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.12</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:599\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.11</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:572\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.10</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.8</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.7</span></a> - </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.6</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:11\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.5</span></a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:12\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.4</span></a> - </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-modded/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:13\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.3</span></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我們歡迎對模組支援的貢獻！1.15/1.16 的支援非常新且不完整。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要參與，請加入我們的 Discord，並在<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/Soartex-Modded/\" rel=\"nofollow\">相關的模組儲存庫</a>中開啟問題或發送 PR。<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果您在下載時遇到任何問題，或發現紋理錯誤，請使用問題追蹤器（上方連結）。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可以在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-vanilla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>找到原版包的下载。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">如需更多關於重新散佈與一般問題的資訊，請造訪我們的網站：&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fsoartex.net%252flicense%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://soartex.net/license/<br></a><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">官方的 </span><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">Minecraft 論壇文章是這篇：&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\" href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/resource-packs/1237576-1-7-x-x64-soartex-fanver-smooth-and-clean\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/resource-packs/1237576-1-7-x-x64-soartex-fanver-smooth-and-clean<br></a><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">官方的 Planet Minecraft 文章是這篇：&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture_pack%252fsoartex-fanver%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.planetminecraft.com/texture_pack/soartex-fanver/<br></a><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">官方的 Feed the Beast 文章是這篇：&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fforum.feed-the-beast.com%252fthreads%252f39834%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://forum.feed-the-beast.com/threads/39834/</a></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
